Ops' daily check (12 Oct 18:45Z), two real faults:

1. ask_contact, 08:34Z, one real account, 4 calls: the „already sent, wait"
   refusal told the model it sent the question „undefined წამის წინ". A
   duplicate caught on another goal has no previous time; the seconds are
   now said only when known (words removed, none added).

2. propose_task_plan, 11 Oct 21:57Z and 23:57Z (test seats): plans of 2,844
   and 1,474 characters, \u-escaped Georgian, failed „Unexpected token �"
   mid-text. 0118 already drops a lone „�"; here an escape was cut in two,
   and the half escape left behind (`\u10`) is still invalid. The half escape
   now goes with its „�", and the plan is used only if it then parses.

